    "&lt;p&gt;The detached outbuilding hereby permitted shall not be occupied at any time other than for purposes incidental to the residential use of the occupiers of 4a Barrow Point, Pinner, HA5 3HF and shall at no point be used as primary living accommodation, rental purposes or any other similar use.&lt;/p&gt;",
